1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:02,570
Why does Lord Vishnu take a four month vacation?

2
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:06,394
From Ashadh Ekadashi in June and July,

3
00:00:06,394 --> 00:00:08,793
he sleeps deeply for four months...

4
00:00:08,793 --> 00:00:11,740
until they conclude on Dev Uthani Ekadashi.

5
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:12,945
But why?

6
00:00:12,945 --> 00:00:15,790
Tradition holds three stories about this.

7
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:19,539
First is the tale of King Bali. As Vaman,

8
00:00:19,539 --> 00:00:22,068
Vishnu asked for three steps of land...

9
00:00:22,068 --> 00:00:23,560
and covered all in two.

10
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:26,088
Nothing remained for the third step.

11
00:00:26,088 --> 00:00:27,530
So Bali bowed his head.

12
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,676
And Vishnu promised,

13
00:00:29,676 --> 00:00:31,469
I will stay at your doorstep.

14
00:00:31,469 --> 00:00:32,767
To keep that promise,

15
00:00:32,767 --> 00:00:36,600
every year he spends four months with Bali in the netherworld.

16
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:39,071
Second is the story of a goddess of sleep,

17
00:00:39,071 --> 00:00:40,639
Yoga Nidra. Through penance,

18
00:00:40,639 --> 00:00:43,270
Yoga Nidra asked Vishnu for a place inside him.

19
00:00:43,390 --> 00:00:44,824
And Vishnu gave her...

20
00:00:44,824 --> 00:00:47,172
a place in his eyes for four months.

21
00:00:47,172 --> 00:00:49,910
Third is the story of a demon, Shankhasur.

22
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:54,462
Vishnu's long battle with Shankhasur left him so exhausted...

23
00:00:54,462 --> 00:00:56,340
he slept in the milk ocean.

24
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:59,095
Yet all three stories say the same thing.

25
00:00:59,095 --> 00:01:01,482
Even the ruler of the world... pauses.

26
00:01:01,482 --> 00:01:02,990
Pausing is not weakness.

27
00:01:03,110 --> 00:01:05,748
And on Dev Uthani Ekadashi, he wakes up...

28
00:01:05,748 --> 00:01:09,580
so auspicious events like weddings resume from that very day.

29
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:13,039
Next story: why did Kumbhakarna ask for sleep?

30
00:01:13,039 --> 00:01:14,430
Follow or subscribe.

